## Metal–Organic Frameworks
Flexible Zirconium Metal-Organic Frameworks as Bioinspired Switchable Catalysts
An open and shut case: The inherent cavities and dynamic behavior of flexible MOFs, bear a close resemblance to regulatory enzymes. Switchable activa
tion and deactivation of their catalytic properties occurs on pore opening and closing by solvation/solvent removal.
